  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, theme 4): closure of this item (Python lacks explicit stdlib catalog; 4477 imports resolve as 'unresolved') is one specific instance of the gap WI-tukif-fuhug-tisiv-judor-pobat-fisat-hadap-zojol covers — that umbrella tracks promoting 12 language catalogs to status=complete with stdlib_provenance. Python is one of the 12. The invariant both serve is INV-pomir-tahap-kizob-fumus-bufog-pubis-narah-napim (every status=complete catalog MUST declare stdlib_provenance with allowlisted hostname suffix)."  # ea98
